- op: discuss  # 7cf2
  at: '2026-04-16T11:37:02Z'  # 7cf2
  by: agent  # 7cf2
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 7cf2
  clock: 6  # 7cf2
  nonce: 7cf2  # 7cf2
  message: "Fixed in PR #3061 (merged to dev at cc5a805a8). Completes the deferred half of WI-fuhav. Pass 1 tagging (meta.extension_receiver) was already in place; Pass 2 now builds an extension_index keyed by receiver-base-name and probes it in a new Case 3b after Case 3 of the method-call extractor. Class methods win over extensions (preserved via the 'not edge_added' guard). Generic receivers collapse at both index-build and lookup time via split-on-'<'. Cross-file resolution works because the index is built from global_symbols. Evidence type: ast_call_extension, confidence 0.80. 2 regression tests added covering cross-file dispatch and generic receiver. 100% coverage, all 87 kotlin tests pass, no regressions in the 2728-test affected set."  # 7cf2
